  "abstract": "Extends RC-DiagLDS by giving each factor two stable decay rates (fast/slow) and a learned per-factor mixture, plus per-horizon gating that increases with horizon. Retains the residual AR(1)-style copy head and shared 4\u219232 increment MLP. Uses k=64 to better capture population structure while keeping memory linear in N.",
